  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\" alt=\"\" width=\"NaN\" height=\"NaN\"></p>\n<h3><img style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1278663978079354931/1307712504884887602/image.png?ex=673b4dad&is=6739fc2d&hm=1db5ee3ef31a45da5e870dcdc0df263923a72118c062e15fdb0334bc9efab10c&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=2880&height=741\" alt=\"\" width=\"1226\" height=\"316\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<h1><strong>概述</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<p>Create: Mixed Nuclear 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-new-age\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: New Age</a> 的擴充模組，為該模組加入了鈾元素，並進行了一些簡單的調整與變更！&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>此模組是為 Create: Civilization 所製作</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>本模組需要安裝 <a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-new-age\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: New Age</a>、<a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-compressed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Compressed</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: TFMG</a> 才能運作</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>功能特色</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>模組中已加入鈾元素，可透過粉碎放射性釷&nbsp;<br>來獲得粉碎鈾。</li>\n<li>貧鈾已作為一種堅固的礦石加入，可用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-tank-defenses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Tank Defenses</a> 中的裝甲方塊。<br><br></li>\n<li>現在可以將鈾錠或釷錠放入以鐵錠製成的空核燃料槽&nbsp;<br>中來製造核子燃料。<br><br></li>\n<li><strong><em>即將推出 - </em></strong><em>鈾元素將具備放射性，若存放於背包中或位於玩家附近時會釋放輻射。</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sDbgTqGMKQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.createcivilization.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c0befc21-1905-453b-bf39-7762de629815.png\" width=\"1314\" height=\"255\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
